# Experiment log: append-only CSV — use union merge to avoid conflicts when
# multiple branches each add rows. Duplicate rows (same timestamp) are benign.
# eol=lf pins the line ending: csv.writer defaults to CRLF, git normalises with
# core.autocrlf=input, and the two disagreeing rewrote all 30 lines of this file
# as invisible churn during the fps-zci schema migration.
experiments/results.csv text eol=lf merge=union
